WEBVTT

00:01:28.339 --> 00:01:36.910 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:39.920 line:0%
[Episode 30]

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.990 line:0%
[Lai's Mansion]

00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:42.770 line:0%
I failed to handle things properly.

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:44.830 line:0%
I didn't capture Shen Du in Yingzhou.

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:46.370 line:0%
Fire Moth Sect in Yingzhou

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:47.880 line:0%
is completely gone?

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:50.240 line:0%
Yes.

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:06.500 line:0%
Losers...

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:09.920 line:0%
can't be kept.

00:02:27.490 --> 00:02:28.790 line:0%
You're badly injured.

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:31.680 line:0%
It seems you'll need some time to recover.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:34.940 line:0%
Have those Half-faced Ghosts in Yingzhou

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.410 line:0%
been dealt with?

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.330 line:0%
I gave them poison beforehand.

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:39.879 line:0%
There are no survivors!

00:02:39.879 --> 00:02:40.680 line:0%
Very good.

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:42.400 line:0%
What about the thing

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:44.360 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi left for Shen Du?

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:47.840 line:0%
This is what Shen Du was looking for.

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:49.240 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:51.820 line:0%
had been watching Yingzhou for so long.

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:52.920 line:0%
He must have gathered dirt

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:54.879 line:0%
on quite a few people in the court.

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:08.890 line:0%
A poetry collection?

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:12.050 line:0%
How could this be?

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.100 line:0%
It must have been swapped

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:15.260 line:0%
by Shen Du back then!

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:16.870 line:0%
You've been fooled by Shen Du!

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:17.510 line:0%
I...

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:26.300 line:0%
[Daily Trade Correspondence]

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:27.040 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:29.560 line:0%
I'd like to see

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:33.040 line:0%
how you plan to break out of this situation.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:09.780 line:0%
I never expected

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:11.880 line:0%
that for all these years,

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:13.400 line:0%
Minister Zhang's faction has been smuggling

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:14.800 line:0%
with Xichen State through Gannan Area

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:16.160 line:0%
to reap massive profits.

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:17.310 line:0%
Even Princess Ying

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:19.190 line:0%
has been bribing frontier soldiers

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:21.040 line:0%
under the guise of funding to win their loyalty.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:21.960 line:0%
Senior secretly seized leverage

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:24.020 line:0%
over two major factions in the court,

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.680 line:0%
yet he never reported it.

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:29.360 line:0%
I suppose he didn't trust the imperial court.

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:31.080 line:0%
Chen Huo'e must have known something about this,

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.280 line:0%
so she wanted to use me

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:33.720 line:0%
to find this booklet.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.880 line:0%
So how do you plan to handle this?

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:36.920 line:0%
I plan...

00:04:36.959 --> 00:04:37.959 line:0%
Grand Commander!

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:40.209 line:0%
Grand Commander, bad news!

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:43.120 line:0%
What's the panic?

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.120 line:0%
The captured Half-faced Ghosts

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:46.080 line:0%
died suddenly before we could

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:47.540 line:0%
extract any information.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.040 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.480 line:0%
it seems they died from poison.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:56.680 line:0%
When they were captured,

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:57.920 line:0%
I searched them thoroughly,

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:58.840 line:0%
even

00:04:58.840 --> 00:04:59.960 line:0%
their teeth.

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:00.680 line:0%
There was no chance

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:02.140 line:0%
for them to ingest poison.

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:17.200 line:0%
[There is a triangular needle wound on Yuanniang's body]

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:19.860 line:0%
The needle mark...

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:22.770 line:0%
How could this be?

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:24.290 line:0%
You found something?

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:29.250 line:0%
Jing Lin was right.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.320 line:0%
They must have been poisoned

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:32.240 line:0%
with a slow-acting toxin

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.360 line:0%
before their capture.

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:34.440 line:0%
Coroner, can you

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:35.240 line:0%
identify the poison?

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:35.760 line:0%
Yes,

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:37.400 line:0%
but it will take some time.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:39.160 line:0%
Report to me immediately once it's confirmed.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:40.420 line:0%
Yes, Grand Commander.

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.620 line:0%
It's time to return to Xiang'an.

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:14.640 line:0%
What are you reading?

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:17.520 line:0%
Along the way,

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:18.960 line:0%
we passed through

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:20.320 line:0%
many places.

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:21.560 line:0%
These

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:23.800 line:0%
are notes I took from casual conversations

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.060 line:0%
with the local people.

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:28.140 line:0%
Have you noticed something unusual?

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:30.020 line:0%
According to their recollections,

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:32.020 line:0%
there is indeed something strange.

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:34.540 line:0%
The year before the Shen family's case,

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:36.720 line:0%
Cang State suffered from a flood.

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:38.760 line:0%
Many people starved

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:40.540 line:0%
due to food shortages.

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:42.950 line:0%
In Gannan Area,

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.720 line:0%
according to the people's recollections,

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:45.720 line:0%
some areas

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:47.520 line:0%
were also affected by the flood.

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:48.560 line:0%
Logically,

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:50.560 line:0%
there should have been insufficient grain.

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:51.640 line:0%
But the local grain prices

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.040 line:0%
fell significantly instead of rising.

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:56.240 line:0%
So where did the suddenly appeared grain

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:57.480 line:0%
come from?

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.050 line:0%
You're suggesting…

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:03.500 line:0%
There is indeed a possibility

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:05.700 line:0%
that someone secretly

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:08.360 line:0%
took grain from the official granaries.

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:30.290 line:0%
Assassins!

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:42.010 line:0%
Xing.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:51.750 line:0%
Let's go!

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:57.870 line:0%
Don't linger!

00:08:58.020 --> 00:08:59.420 line:0%
Let's head to the palace!

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:31.830 line:0%
Lord Shen, you truly care for the country like your own home.

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:33.080 line:0%
You just entered the Imperial City,

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:34.540 line:0%
and already rushed to the palace to report.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:35.600 line:0%
No wonder my mother

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:37.280 line:0%
holds you in such high regard.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:40.930 line:0%
Your Highness, I'm flattered.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.440 line:0%
I'm merely doing my best,

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:43.400 line:0%
hoping not to betray

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:44.760 line:0%
the grand empress dowager's trust.

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:46.640 line:0%
If you truly think this way,

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:48.010 line:0%
that'd be great.

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:50.960 line:0%
At least it won't disappoint

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:52.650 line:0%
my mother's expectations for you.

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:54.650 line:0%
I hope you can rise to great heights.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.520 line:0%
What do you mean by that, Your Highness?

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:02.560 line:0%
Never mind.

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:04.800 line:0%
It's late.

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:10.620 line:0%
Jia'an, you must be tired too, right?

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.250 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:17.930 line:0%
come to my mansion later and we'll talk more.

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:34.760 line:0%
Your Majesty, please have some tea.

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:41.960 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:43.080 line:0%
they're here.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:49.600 line:0%
Greetings, Your Majesty.

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:52.280 line:0%
Your Majesty, wish you great health and prosperity.

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:53.200 line:0%
Rise.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.320 line:0%
Mr. Shen,

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:02.120 line:0%
I have read the memorial

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:04.160 line:0%
you asked them to sent.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:06.360 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi is dead.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:08.900 line:0%
The rebels have been eradicated.

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:12.360 line:0%
The Half-faced Ghosts have also been eliminated.

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:15.240 line:0%
You handled the Yingzhou matter well.

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:17.290 line:0%
During the investigation,

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.600 line:0%
did you encounter any difficulties?

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:23.360 line:0%
Your Majesty, thanks to your blessing,

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:24.890 line:0%
everything went smoothly.

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:29.720 line:0%
What reward should I

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:31.000 line:0%
bestow upon you?

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:34.200 line:0%
Shen Du is already the grand commander of the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:36.080 line:0%
overseeing all levels of officials.

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:37.960 line:0%
He's already a first-rank official.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.560 line:0%
So there's no higher position

00:11:39.560 --> 00:11:40.960 line:0%
to promote him to, right?

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:46.540 line:0%
That mouth of yours...

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:50.410 line:0%
It's only because I dote on you

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:51.690 line:0%
that you speak so freely.

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:52.660 line:0%
Fortunately,

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:54.780 line:0%
Mr. Shen is not an outsider.

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:55.990 line:0%
Otherwise,

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:57.380 line:0%
people might think

00:11:57.410 --> 00:11:59.600 line:0%
I wanted to use you

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:01.560 line:0%
to remind Mr. Shen.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:02.920 line:0%
Your Majesty, please forgive me.

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:04.200 line:0%
It's my fault.

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:05.440 line:0%
Mr. Shen,

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:07.520 line:0%
what do you think?

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:09.400 line:0%
Just tell me what reward

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:11.640 line:0%
you want.

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:13.200 line:0%
I will surely grant it.

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:20.970 line:0%
That was merely my duty.

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:22.490 line:0%
No reward is necessary.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:24.520 line:0%
During the Yingzhou mission,

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:26.040 line:0%
if it weren't for my wife's help,

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.940 line:0%
I'm afraid it wouldn't have gone so smoothly.

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:29.340 line:0%
If a reward is to be given,

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:32.460 line:0%
it should be given to Secretary Yan Xing.

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:37.610 line:0%
So,

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:40.460 line:0%
you want to seek a reward for your wife.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:43.160 line:0%
It seems that the trip to Yingzhou

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:45.960 line:0%
has strengthened your bond.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.920 line:0%
I've done a good deed then.

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:53.060 line:0%
You're wise, Your Majesty.

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:54.120 line:0%
Rise.

00:12:55.980 --> 00:12:59.640 line:0%
Mr. Shen, you are truly a pillar of the state,

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:02.180 line:0%
not claiming credit for your achievements.

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:03.240 line:0%
Very well.

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:04.880 line:0%
I'll reward

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:06.000 line:0%
your wife

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:08.480 line:0%
as you wish.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:12.600 line:0%
Ms. Yan, for your merits in pacifying Yingzhou's chaos,

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:17.240 line:0%
you are promoted to Director under the Ministry of Justice,

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:18.980 line:0%
sixth rank.

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:22.990 line:0%
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:25.610 line:0%
Ms. Yan,

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:27.400 line:0%
is there any other

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:30.970 line:0%
special reward you want?

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:32.840 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:34.400 line:0%
there's

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:35.800 line:0%
nothing else I want.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:38.230 line:0%
Are you sure?

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.870 line:0%
This is a rare opportunity.

00:13:40.560 --> 00:13:42.800 line:0%
Every word I said is true.

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:44.560 line:0%
I do not want a reward.

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:47.610 line:0%
I only wish for peace and prosperity in this world.

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:51.610 line:0%
Good.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:53.060 line:0%
Ms. Yan,

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:54.840 line:0%
as a woman,

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:56.510 line:0%
you still care for the world.

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:58.450 line:0%
Cang State

00:13:58.780 --> 00:13:59.560 line:0%
truly needs

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.720 line:0%
officials like you.

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:04.930 line:0%
I heard that when you were in Yingzhou,

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:07.160 line:0%
you encountered grave danger

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.640 line:0%
and almost lost your lives.

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:11.520 line:0%
Ask an imperial physician to their mansion to treat them.

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:12.320 line:0%
Yes.

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:15.670 line:0%
[Imperial Security Bureau]

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:27.760 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:30.480 line:0%
You just received a reward.

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:31.880 line:0%
Why do you look so gloomy?

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:36.280 line:0%
Director Yan.

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:39.880 line:0%
I just realized it.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:42.300 line:0%
The matter in Yingzhou was significant.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.360 line:0%
The grand empress dowager had to grant a reward for form's sake.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.160 line:0%
But she didn't want to reward you.

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:47.280 line:0%
That Zhang Baohuan

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:48.040 line:0%
must have understood

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.440 line:0%
her thoughts.

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:51.320 line:0%
So he and Madam Xu played a duet,

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:53.040 line:0%
deliberately saying there was no higher rank to grant.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.840 line:0%
They did that just to prevent you from claiming credit.

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:56.120 line:0%
Had you not handled

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.520 line:0%
the situation wisely,

00:14:57.560 --> 00:14:59.560 line:0%
who knows what might have happened?

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:00.840 line:0%
What will you do

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:01.800 line:0%
with the booklet

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:02.920 line:0%
Lord Mo left you?

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:05.230 line:0%
That booklet involves many people.

00:15:06.160 --> 00:15:08.290 line:0%
I'll find the right time to present it.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.720 line:0%
Even foxes can't outwit you.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.040 line:0%
You rushed into the palace in the dead of night

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:13.520 line:0%
to request an audience in front of the grand empress dowager,

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:15.040 line:0%
yet you didn't mention the booklet.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:16.640 line:0%
It was just a feint

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:18.420 line:0%
to make certain people uneasy.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:19.920 line:0%
I'm afraid they

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:21.400 line:0%
can't sleep well tonight.

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:25.970 line:0%
You understand me best,

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:28.030 line:0%
Honey.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:29.940 line:0%
So,

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:32.200 line:0%
I received a reward by doing nothing?

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:37.730 line:0%
Princess Ying said you're devoted to your duty,

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:38.560 line:0%
but you don't need to

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:39.840 line:0%
be devoted to your duty in the middle of the night

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:41.270 line:0%
and not come home, right?

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:44.760 line:0%
There's a place

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:47.720 line:0%
I need to show you.

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:17.850 line:0%
Let's go.

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:02.330 line:0%
[Memorial Tablet of Shen Bingzhu, My Father]

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:33.290 line:0%
This is...

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:35.960 line:0%
This is what I want you

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:36.920 line:0%
to know.

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:45.330 line:0%
Back then, the Shen family was framed,

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:48.370 line:0%
and my mother fell gravely ill.

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:50.440 line:0%
She knew her time was short

00:17:51.690 --> 00:17:53.550 line:0%
and told me to write a confession.

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:54.800 line:0%
I won't write it.

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:56.140 line:0%
And I can't write it.

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:57.120 line:0%
Father

00:17:57.230 --> 00:17:59.510 line:0%
would rather die to prove his innocence.

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.160 line:0%
I'd rather die like Father

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:02.540 line:0%
to prove our innocence.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:04.870 line:0%
But if even you die too,

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:06.600 line:0%
this wrongful case

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:08.660 line:0%
will truly be settled.

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:09.970 line:0%
So many lives

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.010 line:0%
of the Shen family

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:13.600 line:0%
were wrongfully taken,

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:15.060 line:0%
including your father's.

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:17.060 line:0%
Their grievances

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:19.540 line:0%
and the truth they always wanted

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:22.040 line:0%
would die with them!

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:23.940 line:0%
She also told me

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:26.150 line:0%
to endure it for a while and become an official.

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:27.950 line:0%
Only then would there be a chance

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:29.860 line:0%
to clear the Shen family's name.

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:32.920 line:0%
Since that day,

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:34.890 line:0%
I have lived

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:40.010 line:0%
for nothing but vengeance.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:51.480 line:0%
I've been carrying

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:53.240 line:0%
the Shen family's resentment.

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:58.900 line:0%
Seeking the truth of it

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:02.000 line:0%
has become my

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.640 line:0%
only reason to live.

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:17.550 line:0%
Perhaps the world has already forgotten,

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:20.280 line:0%
or no one cares anymore.

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:24.080 line:0%
But I clearly remember

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:26.970 line:0%
every innocent person

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:31.760 line:0%
who died for the Shen family.

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:34.220 line:0%
I dare not forget them even just for a moment.

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:38.240 line:0%
Not just you.

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:41.590 line:0%
Me too.

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:43.860 line:0%
I remember.

00:19:50.300 --> 00:19:52.540 line:0%
I have never forgotten Uncle Shen.

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:55.390 line:0%
[Memorial Tablet of Shen Bingzhu, My Father]

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:56.280 line:0%
When the Shen family fell into trouble,

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:57.240 line:0%
they said

00:19:57.980 --> 00:20:01.380 line:0%
Uncle Shen betrayed the country and colluded with the enemy.

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:02.860 line:0%
I didn't believe it.

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:07.800 line:0%
He was the most upright

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:09.800 line:0%
and selfless person I've ever seen.

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:11.720 line:0%
He would never do anything

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:13.580 line:0%
to harm the country or its people.

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:16.400 line:0%
So from that moment on,

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:19.840 line:0%
I swore

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:22.080 line:0%
to become a female official

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:24.480 line:0%
and be admitted to the Ministry of Justice,

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:26.170 line:0%
hoping that one day,

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:28.840 line:0%
I could uncover the truth myself.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:46.360 line:0%
People call me the White Ghost,

00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:50.240 line:0%
so I've convinced myself

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:52.120 line:0%
that I am indeed a lonely ghost,

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:57.290 line:0%
drifting alone in this living hell.

00:21:03.180 --> 00:21:04.640 line:0%
I really didn't expect...

00:21:09.610 --> 00:21:12.070 line:0%
that there would be someone as foolish as me.

00:21:40.550 --> 00:21:46.260 line:0%
♫I hope you also look up and see the radiant stars and moon♫

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:44.820 line:0%
You're warm,

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:48.930 line:0%
alive and breathing.

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:52.270 line:0%
How could you be a lonely ghost?

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:56.510 line:0%
♫No matter how vast the world is, I'll wait for your appearance♫

00:21:57.700 --> 00:21:58.890 line:0%
Your heart

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:02.670 line:0%
♫A quick glance at each other♫

00:22:00.910 --> 00:22:01.760 line:0%
is beating

00:22:01.760 --> 00:22:03.880 line:0%
with the expectations of so many people.

00:22:03.510 --> 00:22:08.110 line:0%
♫Has warmed the winter in memories♫

00:22:09.370 --> 00:22:16.140 line:0%
♫Don't mind the destined solitude, and shine brightly♫

00:22:12.920 --> 00:22:14.160 line:0%
From now on,

00:22:16.840 --> 00:22:18.520 line:0%
you won't be alone anymore.

00:22:19.320 --> 00:22:22.700 line:0%
♫I'll wait until the years blossom like flowers♫

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:24.560 line:0%
I will do everything I can

00:22:23.600 --> 00:22:27.430 line:0%
♫The ice and snow slowly melted♫

00:22:24.560 --> 00:22:26.210 line:0%
to help you uncover the truth

00:22:27.580 --> 00:22:29.440 line:0%
and clear the Shen family's name.

00:22:29.450 --> 00:22:32.940 line:0%
♫I heard those tender words♫

00:22:33.780 --> 00:22:37.900 line:0%
♫He told her, "I love you"♫

00:22:39.630 --> 00:22:42.910 line:0%
♫What I saw in my dreams♫

00:22:43.730 --> 00:22:47.840 line:0%
♫Is not a flashy illusion♫

00:22:49.040 --> 00:22:53.640 line:0%
♫I don't fear the challenges ahead, riding a white horse to chase after time♫

00:22:54.340 --> 00:22:56.950 line:0%
♫Let's go together♫

00:22:58.580 --> 00:23:03.160 line:0%
♫Love is pure and flawless, indifferent to the changes of the world♫

00:23:03.910 --> 00:23:07.830 line:0%
♫Let's experience it together♫

00:23:04.700 --> 00:23:07.630 line:0%
[Memorial Tablet of Shen Bingzhu, My Father]

00:23:14.210 --> 00:23:15.410 line:0%
Go get the horse.

00:23:15.130 --> 00:23:17.300 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:17.960 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:18.880 line:0%
Madam,

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:20.760 line:0%
you're finally back.

00:23:22.440 --> 00:23:24.100 line:0%
Sorry for making you worried.

00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:33.860 line:0%
No rush, Honey.

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:38.530 line:0%
I'm not.

00:23:39.700 --> 00:23:42.300 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:23:44.600 --> 00:23:46.700 line:0%
The ancestors of the Shen family,

00:23:47.420 --> 00:23:49.110 line:0%
thanks to your blessing,

00:23:48.800 --> 00:23:52.300 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:23:49.510 --> 00:23:52.240 line:0%
Grand Commander has finally come to understand.

00:23:53.610 --> 00:23:55.010 line:0%
He's come to understand.

00:23:55.900 --> 00:23:57.340 line:0%
He's come to understand.

00:24:09.830 --> 00:24:10.910 line:0%
It's late.

00:24:14.600 --> 00:24:16.010 line:0%
Honey, rest early.

00:24:19.710 --> 00:24:20.510 line:0%
Okay.

00:24:30.390 --> 00:24:31.520 line:0%
Where are you going?

00:24:33.560 --> 00:24:34.900 line:0%
To bed.

00:24:54.680 --> 00:24:55.360 line:0%
You and I

00:24:55.360 --> 00:24:57.420 line:0%
have something more important to do.

00:24:58.830 --> 00:25:00.750 line:0%
Shen Du, I...

00:25:02.830 --> 00:25:07.010 line:0%
♫Every memory, I hold it dear♫

00:25:08.090 --> 00:25:11.090 line:0%
♫From desolation, it has become a poem♫

00:25:11.850 --> 00:25:13.310 line:0%
♫Looking back♫

00:25:12.350 --> 00:25:13.470 line:0%
You said

00:25:14.200 --> 00:25:17.260 line:0%
♫We passed through the misty rain and waited for the sunny day♫

00:25:15.440 --> 00:25:16.160 line:0%
from now on, I won't

00:25:16.160 --> 00:25:17.240 line:0%
be alone anymore.

00:25:18.440 --> 00:25:22.800 line:0%
♫Love ripples in each other's eyes♫

00:25:19.490 --> 00:25:21.550 line:0%
Since you had the courage to barge in,

00:25:22.670 --> 00:25:24.520 line:0%
you won't be able to escape from now on.

00:25:23.890 --> 00:25:28.430 line:0%
♫You have long melted the frost in my heart♫

00:25:27.970 --> 00:25:29.410 line:0%
I am

00:25:29.530 --> 00:25:32.630 line:0%
♫So many words to say, but the paper isn't long enough♫

00:25:30.460 --> 00:25:31.790 line:0%
a woman

00:25:32.890 --> 00:25:34.220 line:0%
of my word.

00:25:33.410 --> 00:25:34.760 line:0%
♫Every day♫

00:25:35.630 --> 00:25:38.780 line:0%
♫We test and probe each other♫

00:25:39.360 --> 00:25:43.680 line:0%
♫And before we knew it, we reached forever♫

00:25:44.920 --> 00:25:47.590 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:25:48.010 --> 00:25:51.210 line:0%
♫I want to keep you by my side♫

00:25:52.190 --> 00:25:55.270 line:0%
♫Through the obstacle of wind and rain♫

00:25:55.750 --> 00:25:58.140 line:0%
♫I want to be your moonlight♫

00:25:58.650 --> 00:26:01.970 line:0%
♫Accompany you until every dawn♫

00:26:02.330 --> 00:26:04.500 line:0%
♫How I wish♫

00:26:05.220 --> 00:26:08.440 line:0%
♫I could just forget the passage of time like this♫

00:26:09.260 --> 00:26:11.770 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:26:12.090 --> 00:26:15.620 line:0%
♫May we never forget each other♫

00:26:16.380 --> 00:26:19.700 line:0%
♫There will always be a place for us to meet♫

00:26:20.210 --> 00:26:22.720 line:0%
♫I want to be with you forever♫

00:26:23.210 --> 00:26:26.340 line:0%
♫When our black hair turns grey♫

00:26:26.730 --> 00:26:28.650 line:0%
♫In this life♫

00:26:29.380 --> 00:26:33.260 line:0%
♫I'll only cherish you in my heart♫

00:26:42.250 --> 00:26:44.560 line:0%
Deputy Minister Zhang is here.

00:26:42.380 --> 00:26:49.370 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:26:56.080 --> 00:26:59.010 line:0%
The grand empress dowager sent me to bestow a reward.

00:26:59.500 --> 00:27:02.120 line:0%
Director in the Ministry of Justice,

00:27:02.120 --> 00:27:02.920 line:0%
Yan Xing,

00:27:03.560 --> 00:27:04.740 line:0%
has been rewarded with 10,000 bolts of silk

00:27:04.740 --> 00:27:06.140 line:0%
and 10,000 taels of gold,

00:27:06.720 --> 00:27:08.240 line:0%
in recognition of her merits

00:27:08.240 --> 00:27:10.100 line:0%
and to extend the imperial grace.

00:27:12.410 --> 00:27:15.210 line:0%
I thank the grand empress dowager for the rewards.

00:27:27.050 --> 00:27:29.850 line:0%
The grand empress dowager issued another decree.

00:27:37.120 --> 00:27:38.880 line:0%
The grand empress dowager has given her order.

00:27:38.880 --> 00:27:41.520 line:0%
Shen Du, Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:27:41.520 --> 00:27:42.980 line:0%
has quelled the rebellion

00:27:43.040 --> 00:27:44.760 line:0%
and secured harmony among the states.

00:27:44.760 --> 00:27:46.120 line:0%
His merits are unparalleled,

00:27:46.120 --> 00:27:48.040 line:0%
and his deeds shine across the land.

00:27:48.040 --> 00:27:49.640 line:0%
Princess Jia'an,

00:27:49.820 --> 00:27:51.060 line:0%
gentle and wise,

00:27:51.720 --> 00:27:53.120 line:0%
virtuous and graceful,

00:27:53.600 --> 00:27:54.880 line:0%
elegant

00:27:54.960 --> 00:27:56.480 line:0%
and well-educated,

00:27:56.840 --> 00:27:57.880 line:0%
is now of age

00:27:57.880 --> 00:27:59.350 line:0%
and unmarried.

00:27:59.640 --> 00:28:01.640 line:0%
These two are a match made in heaven.

00:28:01.920 --> 00:28:04.440 line:0%
Hence, I bestow marriage upon them.

00:28:05.080 --> 00:28:07.080 line:0%
May they devote themselves to the country,

00:28:07.080 --> 00:28:08.860 line:0%
united in hearts.

00:28:13.830 --> 00:28:15.820 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:28:22.580 --> 00:28:23.630 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:28:23.920 --> 00:28:26.230 line:0%
this is the grand empress dowager's decree.

00:28:26.230 --> 00:28:27.360 line:0%
It is not something

00:28:27.360 --> 00:28:28.820 line:0%
others can easily change.

00:28:29.850 --> 00:28:32.380 line:0%
At least, you should accept the decree first.

00:29:02.370 --> 00:29:04.500 line:0%
Deputy Minister Zhang, as you can see,

00:29:05.000 --> 00:29:05.680 line:0%
I have no intention

00:29:05.680 --> 00:29:07.340 line:0%
of marrying Princess Jia'an.

00:29:07.840 --> 00:29:09.130 line:0%
And my wife

00:29:09.360 --> 00:29:11.420 line:0%
doesn't want me to take another wife.

00:29:11.780 --> 00:29:14.510 line:0%
Please report that to the grand empress dowager.

00:29:18.770 --> 00:29:19.920 line:0%
Do you know why the grand empress dowager

00:29:19.790 --> 00:29:21.630 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:29:19.920 --> 00:29:21.760 line:0%
sent me to read this decree?

00:29:22.880 --> 00:29:24.040 line:0%
This kind of thing

00:29:24.040 --> 00:29:24.600 line:0%
is supposed to be handled

00:29:24.600 --> 00:29:26.080 line:0%
by someone from the Imperial Astronomer's Office.

00:29:26.080 --> 00:29:27.360 line:0%
But why did she send me?

00:29:29.440 --> 00:29:30.240 line:0%
Why?

00:29:32.440 --> 00:29:33.700 line:0%
You don't understand,

00:29:35.560 --> 00:29:37.890 line:0%
but Grand Commander understands, right?

00:29:44.490 --> 00:29:46.060 line:0%
Please be straightforward

00:29:46.450 --> 00:29:48.090 line:0%
and explain clearly.

00:29:48.130 --> 00:29:51.370 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:29:52.210 --> 00:29:53.670 line:0%
Since Han Shiyuan

00:29:53.760 --> 00:29:54.400 line:0%
has married into

00:29:54.400 --> 00:29:55.400 line:0%
the Yan family,

00:29:55.400 --> 00:29:56.840 line:0%
I'll explain to you,

00:29:56.880 --> 00:29:58.920 line:0%
so that Shiyuan won't blame me for no reason

00:29:58.920 --> 00:30:00.290 line:0%
when he learns of it in the future.

00:30:00.290 --> 00:30:02.090 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:30:01.130 --> 00:30:02.470 line:0%
Think about it.

00:30:02.550 --> 00:30:05.870 line:0%
Princess Jia'an is the most cherished daughter

00:30:05.970 --> 00:30:07.520 line:0%
of Princess Ying.

00:30:08.130 --> 00:30:09.480 line:0%
And Princess Ying is

00:30:09.480 --> 00:30:12.360 line:0%
the grand empress dowager's most cherished princess.

00:30:12.360 --> 00:30:13.640 line:0%
Princess Ying and the grand empress dowager

00:30:13.640 --> 00:30:15.720 line:0%
are quite alike in temperament.

00:30:15.800 --> 00:30:17.960 line:0%
So Princess Ying has been the favorite,

00:30:17.960 --> 00:30:20.790 line:0%
even surpassing Prince Xian.

00:30:21.330 --> 00:30:22.830 line:0%
Yet now,

00:30:23.220 --> 00:30:24.810 line:0%
Princess Jia'an has been granted

00:30:24.810 --> 00:30:27.450 line:0%
to Grand Commander as his second wife.

00:30:27.520 --> 00:30:28.740 line:0%
What does it mean?

00:30:29.610 --> 00:30:31.080 line:0%
Grand Commander holds unrivaled power,

00:30:31.080 --> 00:30:32.500 line:0%
and his merits are outstanding.

00:30:32.500 --> 00:30:33.720 line:0%
And he enjoys

00:30:33.720 --> 00:30:35.810 line:0%
unparalleled glory and respect,

00:30:35.880 --> 00:30:37.690 line:0%
above all others.

00:30:38.720 --> 00:30:40.280 line:0%
But Grand Commander stands alone,

00:30:40.280 --> 00:30:42.080 line:0%
without any powerful backer.

00:30:42.280 --> 00:30:43.160 line:0%
Moreover...

00:30:44.950 --> 00:30:45.840 line:0%
he married you,

00:30:45.840 --> 00:30:47.870 line:0%
a sub-sixth-rank official.

00:30:48.310 --> 00:30:50.590 line:0%
Even if Princess Jia'an is to marry,

00:30:50.720 --> 00:30:52.760 line:0%
she should have her pick among the imperial

00:30:52.760 --> 00:30:54.110 line:0%
and noble families.

00:30:55.090 --> 00:30:57.290 line:0%
She doesn't need to marry Shen Du at all.

00:30:57.410 --> 00:30:58.860 line:0%
Your father said

00:30:58.950 --> 00:31:02.940 line:0%
Shen Du is the only one left in the Shen family.

00:31:03.080 --> 00:31:04.720 line:0%
Now the people related to the Shen family

00:31:04.720 --> 00:31:07.770 line:0%
are only Mo Qianzhi and the butler.

00:31:08.210 --> 00:31:10.740 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi is also dead.

00:31:10.960 --> 00:31:13.180 line:0%
So Shen Du is really

00:31:13.210 --> 00:31:14.320 line:0%
alone

00:31:14.320 --> 00:31:16.910 line:0%
in the court.

00:31:16.940 --> 00:31:19.410 line:0%
And he oversees all officials.

00:31:19.430 --> 00:31:21.710 line:0%
Even the slightest mistake

00:31:21.760 --> 00:31:24.910 line:0%
could easily cost his life.

00:31:30.710 --> 00:31:31.510 line:0%
So,

00:31:34.030 --> 00:31:37.030 line:0%
one must be willing to risk the child to catch the wolf.

00:31:38.540 --> 00:31:40.400 line:0%
Shen Du is that wolf.

00:31:42.320 --> 00:31:44.150 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:31:48.960 --> 00:31:50.290 line:0%
Deputy Minister Zhang,

00:31:52.080 --> 00:31:54.330 line:0%
I can endure whatever precautions the grand empress dowager

00:31:54.330 --> 00:31:55.560 line:0%
takes against me.

00:32:05.310 --> 00:32:07.240 line:0%
But this marriage is unnecessary.

00:32:11.770 --> 00:32:13.230 line:0%
I already have a wife.

00:32:14.580 --> 00:32:17.040 line:0%
And I will not take another wife in this life.

00:32:27.130 --> 00:32:28.460 line:0%
Deputy Minister Zhang,

00:32:30.870 --> 00:32:34.000 line:0%
I'm going with you to the palace to decline the marriage.

00:32:37.560 --> 00:32:40.300 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:32:38.090 --> 00:32:39.130 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:32:39.770 --> 00:32:41.370 line:0%
-Grand Commander!
-Shen Du!

00:32:45.030 --> 00:32:48.490 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:32:56.520 --> 00:32:59.110 line:0%
You're disobeying my order!

00:32:59.620 --> 00:33:00.740 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:33:00.810 --> 00:33:02.670 line:0%
my wife and I love each other very much.

00:33:02.670 --> 00:33:04.020 line:0%
Moreover, I oversee the imperial court

00:33:04.020 --> 00:33:05.790 line:0%
and scrutinize all officials, naturally earning resentment.

00:33:05.790 --> 00:33:07.520 line:0%
It is not a position of wealth or ease.

00:33:07.520 --> 00:33:08.600 line:0%
I do not wish for Princess Jia'an

00:33:08.600 --> 00:33:10.000 line:0%
to suffer by marrying me.

00:33:10.890 --> 00:33:13.010 line:0%
If it weren't for my arrangement,

00:33:13.030 --> 00:33:15.890 line:0%
you'd never have a chance to marry Princess Jia'an!

00:33:16.050 --> 00:33:17.810 line:0%
Princess Jia'an is of noble birth.

00:33:17.810 --> 00:33:19.160 line:0%
I know I am unworthy

00:33:19.380 --> 00:33:20.660 line:0%
and dare not covet her.

00:33:20.830 --> 00:33:23.080 line:0%
Your Majesty, please withdraw the decree.

00:33:23.080 --> 00:33:23.880 line:0%
You...

00:33:26.000 --> 00:33:26.890 line:0%
How dare you!

00:33:33.520 --> 00:33:34.980 line:0%
In all my years of service,

00:33:37.120 --> 00:33:39.380 line:0%
I have never sought anything for myself.

00:33:41.000 --> 00:33:42.310 line:0%
Only today,

00:33:42.730 --> 00:33:44.780 line:0%
Your Majesty, I beg you to withdraw the decree.

00:33:44.780 --> 00:33:46.540 line:0%
I swear I will repay this kindness

00:33:46.540 --> 00:33:49.340 line:0%
with my utmost loyalty, serving to my last breath!

00:33:53.250 --> 00:33:55.710 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen has always been loyal.

00:33:55.790 --> 00:33:57.000 line:0%
His sincerity is evident.

00:33:57.000 --> 00:33:58.720 line:0%
You must think twice.

00:34:02.260 --> 00:34:03.270 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:34:03.600 --> 00:34:04.280 line:0%
I know you're

00:34:04.280 --> 00:34:05.760 line:0%
paving a path for me.

00:34:06.010 --> 00:34:08.080 line:0%
I have stood in this world with an untainted heart,

00:34:08.080 --> 00:34:10.200 line:0%
dedicating myself wholly to easing your burdens.

00:34:10.200 --> 00:34:11.880 line:0%
If my future depends on the marriage

00:34:11.880 --> 00:34:13.289 line:0%
with Princess Jia'an,

00:34:14.720 --> 00:34:16.120 line:0%
it means you

00:34:16.120 --> 00:34:17.720 line:0%
don't trust in my abilities.

00:34:20.189 --> 00:34:21.260 line:0%
Your Majesty!

00:34:21.360 --> 00:34:22.720 line:0%
What's the matter?

00:34:22.920 --> 00:34:24.780 line:0%
Something happened at Ming Hall.

00:34:25.640 --> 00:34:26.430 line:0%
What?

00:34:28.729 --> 00:34:32.890 line:0%
[Chengtian Gate]

00:34:39.920 --> 00:34:42.320 line:0%
The men I sent investigated multiple times.

00:34:42.320 --> 00:34:43.800 line:0%
They didn't find anything amiss.

00:34:43.800 --> 00:34:45.130 line:0%
But this time,

00:34:45.240 --> 00:34:46.560 line:0%
their greed

00:34:46.560 --> 00:34:47.760 line:0%
led them to make a mistake,

00:34:47.760 --> 00:34:49.280 line:0%
which exposed their scheme.

00:34:49.280 --> 00:34:50.830 line:0%
When we traced it back,

00:34:50.920 --> 00:34:52.470 line:0%
we uncovered the issue.

00:34:53.560 --> 00:34:56.450 line:0%
Someone kept dual ledgers.

00:34:57.000 --> 00:34:58.670 line:0%
Dual ledgers?

00:34:58.730 --> 00:35:01.020 line:0%
What does that mean?

00:35:01.880 --> 00:35:03.040 line:0%
Dual ledgers

00:35:03.080 --> 00:35:04.840 line:0%
mean one open ledger

00:35:04.880 --> 00:35:06.520 line:0%
using the Longmen accounting method

00:35:06.520 --> 00:35:07.440 line:0%
and one

00:35:07.440 --> 00:35:08.880 line:0%
secret ledger

00:35:09.040 --> 00:35:11.360 line:0%
using the four-feet accounting method.

00:35:12.840 --> 00:35:13.640 line:0%
Continue.

00:35:15.120 --> 00:35:16.480 line:0%
The open ledger

00:35:16.560 --> 00:35:18.920 line:0%
with the Longmen accounting method

00:35:19.200 --> 00:35:21.330 line:0%
was crafted with exceptional skills.

00:35:21.400 --> 00:35:22.680 line:0%
It looks

00:35:22.760 --> 00:35:25.190 line:0%
flawless on the surface.

00:35:25.460 --> 00:35:27.990 line:0%
That is why since Ming Hall's establishment,

00:35:28.390 --> 00:35:29.930 line:0%
none of the audits on the Ministry of Revenue's key officials

00:35:29.930 --> 00:35:31.510 line:0%
have uncovered any issues.

00:35:31.960 --> 00:35:32.960 line:0%
But

00:35:32.960 --> 00:35:34.240 line:0%
the newly discovered ledger

00:35:34.240 --> 00:35:36.000 line:0%
uses the four-feet accounting method.

00:35:36.000 --> 00:35:37.240 line:0%
So at first glance,

00:35:37.400 --> 00:35:39.640 line:0%
it looks entirely unrelated

00:35:39.680 --> 00:35:41.080 line:0%
to Ming Hall's accounts.

00:35:41.600 --> 00:35:43.200 line:0%
How much has been embezzled?

00:35:58.360 --> 00:36:00.380 line:0%
How dare they!

00:36:00.600 --> 00:36:01.800 line:0%
They actually embezzled

00:36:01.800 --> 00:36:04.200 line:0%
over 20 million taels of silver!

00:36:04.440 --> 00:36:06.360 line:0%
Every official involved in the reconstruction project

00:36:06.360 --> 00:36:07.800 line:0%
is implicated,

00:36:08.240 --> 00:36:10.560 line:0%
except Lord Zhang Baohuan.

00:36:10.840 --> 00:36:13.900 line:0%
Baohuan lacks expertise in accounts

00:36:14.280 --> 00:36:15.810 line:0%
and doesn't have the nerve.

00:36:17.520 --> 00:36:18.400 line:0%
However,

00:36:19.350 --> 00:36:21.090 line:0%
he was the overseer

00:36:21.680 --> 00:36:24.700 line:0%
of the Ming Hall project.

00:36:24.960 --> 00:36:27.380 line:0%
So he is guilty of dereliction of duty.

00:36:27.840 --> 00:36:28.790 line:0%
Send him away.

00:36:29.660 --> 00:36:33.080 line:0%
Ask him to rest quietly in the side yard.

00:36:33.400 --> 00:36:34.200 line:0%
Yes.

00:36:34.310 --> 00:36:35.750 line:0%
As for the others...

00:36:36.590 --> 00:36:37.770 line:0%
Those officials

00:36:38.440 --> 00:36:40.700 line:0%
belong to various factions in the court.

00:36:42.580 --> 00:36:43.950 line:0%
Various factions?

00:36:46.140 --> 00:36:48.500 line:0%
Including my Zhou family?

00:36:50.320 --> 00:36:51.340 line:0%
It's only my assumption.

00:36:51.340 --> 00:36:53.200 line:0%
Your Majesty, please forgive me.

00:37:02.050 --> 00:37:03.980 line:0%
You're not guilty.

00:37:05.560 --> 00:37:06.720 line:0%
I thought

00:37:07.460 --> 00:37:11.050 line:0%
despite the officials' different intentions,

00:37:11.970 --> 00:37:14.130 line:0%
they all cared about the country.

00:37:14.620 --> 00:37:16.680 line:0%
But I never expected

00:37:19.050 --> 00:37:23.470 line:0%
the corruption would fester in the shadows.

00:37:24.020 --> 00:37:25.300 line:0%
Now,

00:37:25.810 --> 00:37:27.390 line:0%
the undercurrents stir,

00:37:28.870 --> 00:37:30.930 line:0%
and men's hearts are unpredictable.

00:37:32.410 --> 00:37:34.760 line:0%
Your Majesty, you've devoted yourself to the country,

00:37:34.760 --> 00:37:36.390 line:0%
but the court officials

00:37:36.520 --> 00:37:38.260 line:0%
each have their own intentions.

00:37:38.260 --> 00:37:39.020 line:0%
Especially

00:37:39.040 --> 00:37:39.870 line:0%
since the incident with Mo Qianzhi,

00:37:39.870 --> 00:37:41.560 line:0%
the prefectural governor of Yingzhou,

00:37:41.560 --> 00:37:43.880 line:0%
no one has been appointed to succeed him in Gannan Area.

00:37:43.880 --> 00:37:44.680 line:0%
I think

00:37:45.320 --> 00:37:47.250 line:0%
they're all getting a bit impatient.

00:37:47.250 --> 00:37:50.870 line:0%
It's time to give them a warning.

00:37:54.810 --> 00:37:56.120 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:37:57.530 --> 00:37:58.880 line:0%
Shen Du's Imperial Security Bureau

00:37:58.880 --> 00:38:00.480 line:0%
seldom interacts with others

00:38:00.480 --> 00:38:02.840 line:0%
and has always carried out its duties diligently.

00:38:02.840 --> 00:38:04.570 line:0%
He would make a good candidate.

00:38:04.760 --> 00:38:05.560 line:0%
However,

00:38:05.920 --> 00:38:07.840 line:0%
if he marries Princess Jia'an,

00:38:08.680 --> 00:38:10.590 line:0%
I'm afraid his hands may be tied

00:38:10.800 --> 00:38:12.240 line:0%
in future matters.

00:38:21.000 --> 00:38:22.640 line:0%
You want to help him.

00:38:22.820 --> 00:38:26.030 line:0%
You should first see if he's smart enough.

00:38:31.410 --> 00:38:32.980 line:0%
Keep the Ming Hall matter

00:38:33.660 --> 00:38:35.330 line:0%
under wraps for now.

00:38:35.890 --> 00:38:37.220 line:0%
Investigate secretly.

00:38:37.400 --> 00:38:38.200 line:0%
Yes.

00:38:38.950 --> 00:38:40.440 line:0%
Deliver my orders

00:38:41.820 --> 00:38:43.860 line:0%
to the Imperial Investigation Department

00:38:43.860 --> 00:38:46.590 line:0%
and the Imperial Security Bureau respectively.

00:39:24.530 --> 00:39:27.230 line:0%
[Chengtian Gate]

00:39:33.880 --> 00:39:35.410 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:39:49.560 --> 00:39:52.280 line:0%
You truly fear nothing.

00:39:53.290 --> 00:39:54.630 line:0%
I originally thought

00:39:54.660 --> 00:39:57.460 line:0%
I'd inevitably suffer some physical punishment,

00:39:57.570 --> 00:39:59.970 line:0%
but it turned out smoother than I imagined.

00:40:01.340 --> 00:40:02.510 line:0%
You mean

00:40:03.100 --> 00:40:06.130 line:0%
the marriage rejection matter is over just like that?

00:40:07.320 --> 00:40:08.320 line:0%
Not necessarily.

00:40:09.450 --> 00:40:10.800 line:0%
The grand empress dowager's anger

00:40:10.800 --> 00:40:12.130 line:0%
hasn't been vented yet.

00:40:14.610 --> 00:40:17.200 line:0%
But the marriage decree came about strangely.

00:40:17.200 --> 00:40:19.460 line:0%
I'm afraid it's related to that booklet.

00:40:19.900 --> 00:40:21.510 line:0%
I guess Princess Ying

00:40:21.760 --> 00:40:22.440 line:0%
was worried I would

00:40:22.440 --> 00:40:25.120 line:0%
present the evidence of her funding the Yingzhou troops,

00:40:25.120 --> 00:40:27.720 line:0%
so she told the grand empress dowager to arrange the marriage,

00:40:27.720 --> 00:40:29.170 line:0%
hoping to tie me down.

00:40:30.490 --> 00:40:31.620 line:0%
But unfortunately,

00:40:32.280 --> 00:40:34.880 line:0%
the grand empress dowager has no time for this.

00:40:38.300 --> 00:40:40.630 line:0%
Something serious happened at Ming Hall?

00:40:43.640 --> 00:40:45.340 line:0%
You knew about that long ago?

00:40:50.080 --> 00:40:50.880 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:40:52.880 --> 00:40:54.200 line:0%
so,

00:40:54.290 --> 00:40:56.870 line:0%
Madam Xu's report on the matter

00:40:56.920 --> 00:40:58.260 line:0%
was not a coincidence?

00:40:58.400 --> 00:40:59.890 line:0%
People don't know

00:41:00.250 --> 00:41:02.390 line:0%
Ming Hall holds special significance

00:41:02.520 --> 00:41:04.250 line:0%
for the grand empress dowager.

00:41:05.760 --> 00:41:07.080 line:0%
It witnessed the love

00:41:07.080 --> 00:41:08.970 line:0%
between the grand empress dowager and the late emperor.

00:41:08.970 --> 00:41:10.500 line:0%
After the fire at Ming Hall,

00:41:10.760 --> 00:41:12.240 line:0%
the grand empress dowager was extremely concerned

00:41:12.240 --> 00:41:13.640 line:0%
about its reconstruction.

00:41:13.640 --> 00:41:14.440 line:0%
She sent

00:41:14.440 --> 00:41:15.400 line:0%
her most trusted

00:41:15.400 --> 00:41:16.760 line:0%
Zhang Baohuan to oversee it

00:41:16.760 --> 00:41:17.600 line:0%
and decreed

00:41:17.800 --> 00:41:20.260 line:0%
the funding should have no upper limit.

00:41:20.300 --> 00:41:21.630 line:0%
No upper limit?

00:41:22.880 --> 00:41:24.000 line:0%
No upper limit

00:41:24.320 --> 00:41:25.600 line:0%
didn't mean the officials

00:41:25.600 --> 00:41:27.260 line:0%
could line their own pockets.

00:41:28.640 --> 00:41:30.320 line:0%
How much was involved?

00:41:32.120 --> 00:41:34.850 line:0%
I'm afraid it's enough to shake the entire court.

00:41:36.870 --> 00:41:38.440 line:0%
They've completely enraged

00:41:38.440 --> 00:41:39.560 line:0%
the grand empress dowager.